+ * length).  Returns 0 and the packed index published after the post, plus the
+ * device-consumed rptr read back from the table entry.  Negative errno
+ * otherwise (-ENODEV not bound/closed, -EPERM write gate, -EIO read-back).
+ *
+ * hi5622_dp_tx_data_poll() - read the device-RAM table entry (published wptr
+ * / device rptr) for one TID.  Never writes. */
